{"parse": {"title": "旧雨臻选衣箱·Unique", "pageid": 139425, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"旧雨臻选衣箱·Unique\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5c/Item-713202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"旧雨臻选衣箱·Unique\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>旧雨臻选衣箱·Unique</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#713202</div></div><hr /><div>使用后可从中挑选指定的1件Unique档位衣着。若已拥有此范围内的所有衣着，则转化为<span style=\"color:#AC5320\">粹雨滴</span>*1680。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">或许在你眼中它曾耀眼、绚烂，但无论出于何种原因，亲爱的，你将它遗落在记忆里，陈列在橱窗中。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"310003\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E6%81%B6%E4%B9%8B%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"衣着/恶之果\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%